  "historyNote": "#9849-A, eff 1-12-11, EXPIRED: 1-12-19 New. #12720, INTERIM, eff 1-29-19, EXPIRED: 7-29-19 New. #12936, eff 12-7-19 (formerly He-E 501.15); ss by #14298, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
